e: a declarative administrator-facing API, reconciliation, and\n51\t  lifecycle management (install, upgrade, scale, removal).\n52\t- Consume the productized Milvus image by pinned digest from the sanctioned\n53\t  registry.\n54\t- Operator-managed rollout and rollback behavior appropriate for a\n55\t  platform-managed service.\n56\t\n57\t## Acceptance Criteria\n58\t\n59\t- Administrators can deploy the managed vector store through the Platform\n60\t  Operator without manual manifest editing.\n61\t- The deployment consumes the productized Milvus image, pinned by digest\n62\t  from the sanctioned registry (pinned digest available from the build\n63\t  pipeline).\n64\t- Lifecycle operations (upgrade, scale, removal) are performed through the\n65\t  operator without direct manipulation of underlying resources.\n66\t- Changes pass the Platform Operator's build pipeline (green).\n67\t\n68\t## HLR Traceability\n69\t\n70\t- HLR-2 (P0, platform-managed variant): administrators can deploy the\n71\t  managed vector store through the Platform Operator with productized\n72\t  images.\n73\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-82de540447b0cce7","agent_id":"a313bdc5523438bd1","session_id":"1cf9837f-a22c-4111-9c91-090881190567","uuid":"4d4b24fe-7c72-4bd9-930a-c53e34e5f0e3","timestamp":"2026-10-21T21:58:01.672Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a3cade4ce4b4f45f","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9007 decomposition"}
